    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90182.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "Great. We thought we would start with, I think, the most relevant and biggest topic for us right now, and particularly in the last few couple weeks, is about the New York state budget. We know it's been a little late this year and of course we are in the field of intellectual and developmental disabilities very interested and have been advocating very heavily for the 8.5% COLA and wage enhancement. So I'm wondering If you could share with us a little bit about the budget process, where you think it's headed, do you feel like there's more that we can do as advocates to bring more people into this and to let the governor know where we stand?",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_03",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
