        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Advocacy efforts can meaningfully impact the final budget decisions.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s organization holds credibility and legitimacy as a representative voice in policy discussions.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The governor values input from advocacy groups on issues related to disability services.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
