    "turn_text": "we have an important. So I certainly understand all of that. You know, I'm going to take the wage enhancement piece first, which is, you know, not the greatest of news. I don't. I am certainly a supporter of it. And I feel like it is absolutely necessary to do something this so that we have basically a standalone enhancement or minimum wage for our DSPs.",
